@API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### Versioned base route
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Accept: application/json

### Database connection
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/house/database
Accept: application/json

### Register with email and password
POST {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "person@example.com",
  "password": "Abcdefgh12"
}

### Confirm the email (token from the verification link)
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/verify-email?token=<token>

### CORS disallowed origin
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Origin: http://disallowed-origin.example
Accept: application/json

### CORS allowed origin
GET {{API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/house
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Accept: application/json
